ASK pdb: Run a query to find the 10 most frequently reported HTL materials in n-i-p perovskite solar cells with PCE > 20%. To avoid repeating previous queries, formulate the query using case-insensitive matching for architecture and filtering out empty/null HTL values:
SELECT HTL_stack_sequence, COUNT(*) AS device_count, COUNT(DISTINCT Ref_DOI_number) AS paper_count FROM devices WHERE LOWER(Cell_architecture) LIKE '%nip%' AND JV_default_PCE > 20 AND HTL_stack_sequence IS NOT NULL AND TRIM(HTL_stack_sequence) != '' GROUP BY HTL_stack_sequence ORDER BY device_count DESC LIMIT 10;
If needed, inspect the distinct values of Cell_architecture or available HTL columns first, then return the top 10 HTL materials, their device counts, paper counts, and percentage shares.
